# What EAS Build uploads.
#
# The archive root is the git repo root, not mobile/ — it has to be, because
# mobile/ imports from shared/ via a path alias and Metro needs both. But the
# Android build has no use for the Laravel API or the admin panel, and
# including them costs upload time on every build.
#
# It is also a correctness fix, not just an optimisation: backend/public/storage
# is a symlink created by `php artisan storage:link`, and Windows cannot
# recreate symlinks during the archive step without elevated privileges, which
# failed the build outright.

backend/
web/
docs/

# Reference documents, not build inputs.
# Anchored and exact on purpose: a loose `*.PNG` glob risks matching the app's
# own icon.png case-insensitively on Windows, which would fail prebuild on a
# missing asset — a genuinely hard failure to diagnose from a build log.
/*.docx
/~$*
/PBLogo.PNG

# Local artefacts.
.expo-export-test/
**/node_modules/
